            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Makoto_Growup_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0079/ch0079_growup_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "I see, even me, who has reached the pinnacle of leadership, has room to grow... Kihihi!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20033,
            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Makoto_Growup_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0079/ch0079_growup_2",
            "LocalizeEN": "To have sensei's backing... Then without further ado. Kihihi!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20033,
            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Makoto_Growup_3",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0079/ch0079_growup_3",
            "LocalizeEN": "Hm... You're expecting quite a bit from me.\nWell then. I will just live up to them, Kihihi!"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20033,
            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Makoto_Growup_4",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0079/ch0079_growup_4",
            "LocalizeEN": "Brilliant ones deserve appropriate rewards. Kihihi, naturally"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20033,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Makoto_Relationship_Up_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0079/ch0079_relationship_up_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "Lately, talking to Sensei has been getting more enjoyable\nKihihi, don't you feel the same as well?"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20033,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Makoto_Relationship_Up_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0079/ch0079_relationship_up_2",
            "LocalizeEN": "Ah, Sensei, there you are.\nJust as I've gotten some free time, let's have a chat for a bit."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20033,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Makoto_Relationship_Up_3",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0079/ch0079_relationship_up_3",
            "LocalizeEN": "Getting away from the busy days, spending time relaxed like this isn't too bad.\n...Kihihi, i like this"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20033,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Makoto_Relationship_Up_4",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0079/ch0079_relationship_up_4",
            "LocalizeEN": "Kihihi, you can rely on me more, Sensei.\nI am Pandemonium Society's leader, the Supreme Hanuma Makoto after all"
        }
    ]
